	(text "- 5 nodes, bottom face, fire down into the bin below\n- Per node: 5 mm 940 nm IR LED from 5 V, R_LED footprint 100R-2k2 (start 180R)\n- AO3400A low side, 100R gate, 100k gate pull-down, 10R source sense\n- Gates driven from one RMT 38 kHz carrier routed by the GPIO matrix\n- LED returns to connector GND, not under the TSOP row\n- Node 1: TP gate, TP sense + GND"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 30 0)
